@* The site's settings (FX163, Louis: "a 3 line menu there which will open a sticky menu then we put those buttons
   there"): a panel down the right of the screen, opened from the header's three-line button, which stays as the page
   scrolls, holding the look switches and the site's own settings and lesser links. *@
<aside class="site-settings" id="site-settings" data-open="@Open">
    @if (Looks)
    {
        <LookSwitch/>
    }
    @ChildContent
</aside>
